{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"outcome\":\"ready-for-verification\",\"planSummary\":\"Aligned Story 4 package publication around same-project membership plus bounded current package-building context, then refreshed coverage so mixed-producer package publish/review/export and reopened pinned-version reuse are exercised end to end.\",\"changedFiles\":[{\"path\":\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\",\"reason\":\"Updated the in-memory package publication path to validate same-project members against current refs or already-pinned package-context versions instead of same-process production.\"},{\"path\":\"convex/packageSnapshots.ts\",\"reason\":\"Reworked durable package snapshot publication to allow mixed-producer members only when they belong to the same project and are valid in the publishing process’s current package-building context.\"},{\"path\":\"convex/packageSnapshots.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Expanded package snapshot tests for mixed-producer success, cross-project rejection, and bounded-context rejection.\"},{\"path\":\"convex/processPackageContexts.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added package-context durability coverage for ordered upsert/read behavior, duplicate cleanup, clear behavior, and republishing an earlier pinned version after reopen.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Adjusted package review fixtures and assertions so mixed-producer package members remain reviewable with pinned provenance.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Adjusted export fixtures so mixed-producer packages still export pinned contents successfully.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Seeded current refs in package-publication integration paths so the stricter Story 4 publication eligibility rule is exercised correctly.\"}],\"tests\":{\"added\":[\"convex/processPackageContexts.test.ts\"],\"modified\":[\"convex/packageSnapshots.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts\",\"tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts\"],\"removed\":[],\"totalAfterStory\":543,\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\":5},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/packageSnapshots.test.ts convex/processPackageContexts.test.ts tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts --environment node\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"selfReview\":{\"findingsFixed\":[\"Removed the outdated same-process package publication restriction from both durable and in-memory publication paths.\",\"Added regression coverage for mixed-producer package publication, review, export, and reopened pinned-version reuse.\",\"Fixed the integration fixture omissions exposed by the stricter publish rule by seeding the publishing process’s current refs where publication is expected to succeed.\"],\"findingsSurfaced\":[]},\"openQuestions\":[],\"specDeviations\":[],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"Hand off to verification; both the Story gate and Epic gate are green.\"}"}}
