{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"The second self-review turned up one real gap: we proved reopened pinned-version eligibility, but not the tech-design obligation that reopening from a published package auto-seeds the current package context from the snapshot. I’m tightening that now in both durable and in-memory paths and adding direct evidence for it."}}
